# The pre-Gradle bootstrap: jars fetched by hand into the project, and the spike's own copies.
# Anchored to specific locations rather than a bare `lib/` or `out/`, which would silently swallow
# any source directory that ever happens to be called that.
/lib/
/out/
spike-text-render/lib/
spike-text-render/out/

